  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "一隻貓仔tshuā我沓沓仔行"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>劉靜媛</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我是一个無才調飼動物ê人。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工親像蜂仝款，無閒tshih-tshih，sì-kè飛來飛去，beh上班koh ài舞厝--裡大細項代誌，lóng已經睏無眠--ah，有閒工ê時iáu是好好停睏khah實在。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh有時tsūn，千算萬算，m̄值天一劃。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">五冬前ê舊曆年，天氣tsiok冷，寒kah phi̍h-phi̍h-tshuah，雖bóng是bih tī厝--裡，mā感覺跤手冷吱吱，根本to無想beh tín動。M̄-nā是人，連外口sì-kè tshit-thô ê貓仔，lóng勼tī阮兜ê埕斗，看--起-來有淡薄仔可憐。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcTCILpGOp4LwxjLtKseosLGGKLFxJM-fkM2XQKvE8gksCv0G2rHKUF1yyc6UG_vQFM5_QKO_WC7t0tRKvGA5hevgPgs9FhccFctqMy1w55ODpJcZA_WARmCDURpJMPQJKlLl9cLvOoXrvZrrTUJqnreFNu8A8ufLqpcQtALmQei373Oub99FC71vecWjG/s960/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA3.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"646\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"430\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcTCILpGOp4LwxjLtKseosLGGKLFxJM-fkM2XQKvE8gksCv0G2rHKUF1yyc6UG_vQFM5_QKO_WC7t0tRKvGA5hevgPgs9FhccFctqMy1w55ODpJcZA_WARmCDURpJMPQJKlLl9cLvOoXrvZrrTUJqnreFNu8A8ufLqpcQtALmQei373Oub99FC71vecWjG/w640-h430/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA3.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj1_HmSH_0JzYs7M2UjkBRbHAsLp5ZYzoX2eLcUKCrunkRUJMzUWWC1n8WqkbQ3ip9xHP71r8BS6fSvFT4NIoqHGgKaQzq4QOJJBDrOlOFRKGHkwQny9cymcuSiXrH9U0H65ENnQHFfEby_tnR3Tl91399etNJEJ9aAQmbX4EA3ocJAWXjorlbjBd0cSTSO/s960/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA9.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj1_HmSH_0JzYs7M2UjkBRbHAsLp5ZYzoX2eLcUKCrunkRUJMzUWWC1n8WqkbQ3ip9xHP71r8BS6fSvFT4NIoqHGgKaQzq4QOJJBDrOlOFRKGHkwQny9cymcuSiXrH9U0H65ENnQHFfEby_tnR3Tl91399etNJEJ9aAQmbX4EA3ocJAWXjorlbjBd0cSTSO/w480-h640/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA9.JPG\" width=\"480\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgsFiLfrqEfeiNpDYecX6GqcHhBAmIoXmw53QNT0T6P7rTA2X2XaM04FDJ8lV9GsDEWLy1ede_jyIvgS2szcxDElahpEfculLiMEJxlmni9s6r3wduP1Cr2ScHkQVr9WbW2MjkeBHLyy1nIuqriwR7cvWH4wlb_BV7-r0cOsh2SZKiElQfkzfzHoBf0ktqu/s960/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA11.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgsFiLfrqEfeiNpDYecX6GqcHhBAmIoXmw53QNT0T6P7rTA2X2XaM04FDJ8lV9GsDEWLy1ede_jyIvgS2szcxDElahpEfculLiMEJxlmni9s6r3wduP1Cr2ScHkQVr9WbW2MjkeBHLyy1nIuqriwR7cvWH4wlb_BV7-r0cOsh2SZKiElQfkzfzHoBf0ktqu/w640-h480/%E8%B2%93%E5%92%AA11.JPG\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><span><a name='more'></a></span><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Tah，tse hōo你睏--lah！」我提一跤紙箱仔hōo--伊，ǹg望伊暗時mài寒--著，ke減ē-tàng閃風。Tsit隻三花貓仔真乖，bē烏白叫mā bē烏白kā人jiàu，看著有人倚--來ê時，ē用伊hit蕊大目睭金金siòng，確定是厝內底的ê人了後，就ē tī阮ê跤邊se̍h來se̍h去。久--來是愈看愈古錐。對我來講，是一个tsiânn趣味ê人客。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過年過節ê時，阮翁興揣人拍麻雀，有一日暗時，伊歡歡喜喜買罐頭tńg來飼貓仔，講是tsit隻貓仔tài財，tsiah hōo伊贏錢！貓仔m̄ bat代誌，有罐頭thang食就kánn-ná是天大ê好mi̍h，三兩喙就食kah清氣tang-tang。自án-ne了後，tsit个人客就蹛tī埕斗，日--時出去tshit-thô，暗時tńg來睏，日子過了tsiânn自在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拜六拄好有閒，我tī埕斗看hit隻貓仔，想講伊最近是按怎一直ài tī紙箱仔hia跳出跳入，到底內面是有啥mih好sńg ê mi̍h件？我來kā看māi--leh。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「啊！」無看無代誌，雄雄看--著suah tio̍h驚！「Tse是啥mih貨--啊？」四隻粉紅仔色ê mi̍h件tī箱仔內底tín動，「Kám講……是貓仔囝？」詳細kā看，除了粉紅仔色ê身軀，mā已經有薄薄仔毛，柑仔色、白色、兩隻虎斑，阿娘uê--啊！Tsit-má是beh按怎處理--啊？「你到底是tang時生--ê？我實在m̄知beh按怎kā你tàu-sann-kāng，你tio̍h-ài家己飼hōo大漢--neh。」貓仔ná看--我ná聽我講話，kánn-ná聽有ê款，等我講煞，伊koh再跳入去箱仔內，kah伊ê貓仔囝kheh做伙。Hit時，我ê心肝頭感覺tsiok溫暖，檢采阮lóng是做人阿母，愛囝兒ê心是sio仝--ê，tse是阮厝內底ê大喜事。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">埕斗逐工lóng tsiok鬧熱，貓母除了飼奶，koh ē教囡仔學行路，四隻幼貓仔囝mā ē tī hia píng來píng去，sńg kah tsiok歡喜，貓母去佗位，囡仔就tuè去佗位，看著mā心適心適。時間leh過真正tsiok緊，目睭一下nih就兩個外月--ah，幼貓仔lóng ē行ē走，mā已經斷奶。Tsit个時tsūn，suah發生一件奇怪ê代誌——貓母無--去--ah！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">照理講，伊是一个有擔當ê阿母，就算講出--去mā ē tńg來顧囡仔，m̄知kám是發生啥mih代誌？我有淡薄仔掛心，招阮查某囝鬥陣去外口揣，tsông幾若工mā是揣無著，好佳哉幼貓仔已經leh食飼料--ah，tsiah bē等無阿母iau腹肚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「阿母，我聽人講貓仔若是感覺beh tńg--去ê時，ē bih--起-來。」&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽著查某囝án-ne講，我ê心內無啥好過，因為siunn濟工--ah，按怎揣to無消無息，kám是真正親像人講--ê，貓仔ē刁工走去bih？我kā門拍--開行到埕斗，心肝頭phi̍h-pho̍k跳，m̄管有影無影，對我來講lóng m̄是好消息。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一隻幼貓仔，tsit幾工無看著in阿母，bē食bē睏，尾仔lóng beh無毛--ah，真正hōo人tsiok m̄甘，伊恬恬phak tī壁邊，看--起-來無攬無ne。「Lín阿母m̄知tī佗位，你mài傷心--lah，我ē照顧--你，啊你是leh看啥mi̍h？」我khû落來kā伊摸摸--leh，ǹg望ē-tàng hōo伊khah好過。Tsit時，暗bîn-bong ê埕斗，雄雄有一種沉重ê氣氛，幼貓仔tshuā我揣著in阿母--ah，伊tī壁邊ê桌仔下跤，ná親像睏--去ê款……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「你就安心仔去，阮ē好好仔照顧你ê囡仔，kā in tshiânn養大漢。」He是一个目屎滴目屎流、心酸酸ê暗暝。隔tńg工，阮規家伙仔伴伊行最後一tsuā路，hōo伊tuè tī菩薩身軀邊，無病無疼去西方世界。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">感謝天公伯--à，hōo阮tsit段緣份。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐工下班tńg--去看著你，一工ê疲勞就消一半，頭殼mā ē-tàng放hōo空空，koh-khah無閒，跤步mā ē為你停--落-來，對我來講，你就親像一个好朋友，逐不時叫我khah慢--leh，tsiah bē食緊挵破碗。雖bóng tsit-má ê生活有時iáu是無閒kah烏天暗地，m̄-koh我ē提醒家己，行khah慢--一-屑-仔，沓沓仔行，免趕緊，就親像以早你陪伴--我ê時tsūn。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhbAMhhJ4jBgdq2WIcHSVG_V17YagUZsRUmLmI8LjBVMkzMOSslohQ0Wi4q875HwYsGDkrZQTKSePIH-35Og4XdYYNNAsFU7ylOwsay3837TyjSQxNCXB5KULBZfI5vSCiyg9OljaMdEz5dHnf2m-ZA6IA2juTt-yabvQ65BddgRI6M43WtqUWax9qfHWf8/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_17.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\